{"about_the_game":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where the Third Reich emerged victorious, Britain endures under totalitarian rule. A mysterious infection has plagued the population for decades. You are a guard stationed at District Eight's quarantine gate. Your duty: decide who lives, who dies, and who enters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133660/extras/5950566e1773ac9976e0bdcebcdd6cbe.avif?t=1765118849\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DAILY DUTY</strong><br>Each day, three strangers arrive at your gate, each with a story, a plea, and the potential of infection. Using limited tools and your own judgment, you must determine their fate:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let them in</strong>, but risk introducing infection or instability to the district</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn them away</strong>, condemning them to the wasteland beyond</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use your shotgun</strong> - Risky, but it's the only guaranteed way to eliminate a threat</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133660/extras/88acb8ad98dc068e54b323e36b69dd7b.avif?t=1765118849\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOUR TOOLS FOR JUDGMENT</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infrared Scanner</strong>: Detect fevers and abnormal body heat patterns</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133660/extras/4e9b5a54f0dd55edffe52274b10546ef.avif?t=1765118849\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Health Check Form</strong>: Identify wounds, bites, and visible symptoms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133660/extras/b65eefd867451a8c0ae19adc17c1273a.avif?t=1765118849\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stethoscope</strong>: Listen for irregular heartbeat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133660/extras/0d99139b7acc049ac381daad6e6986dd.avif?t=1765118849\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terminal Database</strong>: Verify identity, occupation, and criminal records</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dialogue and Interrogation</strong>: Spot lies and inconsistencies by cross-referencing information</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133660/extras/5bf09dfc130ad9c696f1c4169399d8d4.avif?t=1765118849\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Notepad</strong>: Track clues, observations, and suspicions about each visitor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133660/extras/17e842af0180d2879f3a3f3aa4d5bebd.avif?t=1765118849\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DISTRICT STABILITY AND SURVIVAL</strong><br>Your decisions directly impact District Eight's stability across four critical areas:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Food</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Security</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Health</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Morale</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133660/extras/e5b6fa2bac1cd9b9a3ef18109e84f400.avif?t=1765118849\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allow stability to deteriorate, and your salary will suffer. Severely low district stats may even force you to turn away healthy individuals to maintain order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MONEY, PRESSURE AND CONSEQUENCES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn your salary based on <strong>daily performance</strong> and <strong>district stability</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage expenses for essential supplies like <strong>shotgun shells and infrared batteries</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random events</strong> can further drain your already limited funds</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133660/extras/3740f55b10adf95309d9666a0e1b686b.avif?t=1765118849\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>12 Different Endings</strong>: Your choices determine the fate of District Eight and your personal story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>60+ Unique Characters</strong>: Randomized traits, dialogue details, and appearances ensure high replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moral Deduction Under Pressure</strong>: Make critical decisions with incomplete information</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Pixel Art</strong>: A grim, tense visual style portraying a broken world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strong &quot;One More Day&quot; Loop</strong>: Short sessions with escalating tension where one wrong decision can end your run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable characters and endings through repeated playthroughs</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE ULTIMATE QUESTION</strong><br>Can you balance ruthless efficiency with human compassion? Will you become another cog in the Reich's machine, or will you find a way to break it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your duty demands perfection. Your conscience begs for mercy. Neither can be ignored.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4133660?t=1765118849","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133660/1bfdb2a30f39e894a2ff159337cb2f7f73da3b22/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765118849","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133660/5bb4e7244d6b3232fb1f584e4054698fa330985b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765118849","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133660/5bb4e7244d6b3232fb1f584e4054698fa330985b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765118849","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"This game contains mild stylized violence and psychological horror themes.\r\nPlayers may encounter disturbing dialogue, depictions of death, and morally challenging choices.\r\nThere are some sexual and self-harm themes."},"demos":[{"appid":4143880,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where the Third Reich emerged victorious, Britain endures under totalitarian rule. A mysterious infection has plagued the population for decades. You are a guard stationed at District Eight's quarantine gate. Your duty: decide who lives, who dies, and who enters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133660/extras/5950566e1773ac9976e0bdcebcdd6cbe.avif?t=1765118849\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DAILY DUTY</strong><br>Each day, three strangers arrive at your gate, each with a story, a plea, and the potential of infection. Using limited tools and your own judgment, you must determine their fate:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let them in</strong>, but risk introducing infection or instability to the district</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn them away</strong>, condemning them to the wasteland beyond</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use your shotgun</strong> - Risky, but it's the only guaranteed way to eliminate a threat</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133660/extras/88acb8ad98dc068e54b323e36b69dd7b.avif?t=1765118849\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOUR TOOLS FOR JUDGMENT</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infrared Scanner</strong>: Detect fevers and abnormal body heat patterns</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"htt